        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One day many years ago, I was talking to my grandson, Youri, about what we wanted most in life. “I want to see penguins,” he told me. “That’s funny!” I replied. “I had the same dream when I was your age.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But why penguins? "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " he nor I knew. Maybe it was "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " these animals were distant and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "mysterious",
            "ref": "v-mysterious"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to us. The nearest penguins lived in South America, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " we were in France. Over the years, Youri and I talked about penguins from time to time "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "as if",
            "ref": "v-as-if"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to remind "
          },
