            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " never to let our dreams slip away."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Before Christmas last year, I received a postcard from Youri. He was on holiday in Italy. “The place is lovely,” he wrote, “"
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " there are no penguins.” These words "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "touched",
            "ref": "v-touch"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " something deep inside of me. I checked my "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "savings",
            "ref": "v-saving"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and messaged him, “Come on, let’s go and see them!”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This past February, we set off. We "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "fly"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Buenos Aires",
            "zh": "布宜诺斯艾利斯"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and then crossed Patagonia by bus to Tierra del Fuego. Youri, now 24, took good care of me every step of the way. Along the way, some French tourists said to me, “You’re lucky "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "have"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " such a caring grandson!” They were right. Having Youri by my side made the trip one of the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "memorable"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " experiences of my life."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "We saw the penguins on the banks of the Beagle Channel in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Argentina",
            "zh": "阿根廷"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". An adult penguin "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "popped",
            "zh": "冒出"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " out of the water and made its way to its chick. It then coughed up a mouthful of fish it "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "catch"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The penguin looked tired, but as the young penguin eagerly ate the fish, the adult lay on its side, eyes half-closed, clearly satisfied."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "These days, when I look at Youri, I feel just "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that penguin."
          }
        ]
      }
